%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% expect-output: false
% Scenario: overprint is recorded. A Separation fill with overprint on
% and a second with it off (PLRM3 §4.8.5 setoverprint): the dump shows
% an overprint setting before the first fill and its reset before the
% second, and the distilled page carries one extended graphics state
% per value, selected before each fill. The setting survives a
% gsave/grestore round trip unchanged.
[/Separation /Spot /DeviceCMYK {0 0 0 4 -1 roll}] setcolorspace
0.6 setcolor
true setoverprint
100 100 200 200 rectfill
false setoverprint
350 100 200 200 rectfill
gsave true setoverprint grestore currentoverprint =
showpage
